sequenceDiagram
    participant QE as QueryEngine
    participant CTX as context.ts
    participant MD as CLAUDE.md
    participant FW as FileWatcher
    participant API as API 调用

    QE->>CTX: getUserContext(cwd)
    CTX->>MD: 向上遍历加载
